**Skunkflix — Your Media. Your Server. Your Way.**

Skunkflix is a modern, streamlined media player designed for accessing your personal Plex Media Server library from iPhone and iPad.

Connect securely with your Plex account and enjoy your movies, TV shows and personal media through a clean, easy-to-use interface built around your own library.

Browse your movie and television collections, continue watching where you left off, search your library, manage your watchlist and explore seasons and episodes without unnecessary clutter.

Skunkflix includes support for video playback, audio and subtitle selection, playback quality controls, Plex Home profiles and Chromecast, making it easy to enjoy your media on your device or cast it to a compatible screen.

**Features include:**

* Plex account sign-in
* Access to authorized Plex Media Servers
* Movies and TV library browsing
* Continue Watching
* Recently added content
* Search
* Watchlist management
* Movie, series, season and episode information
* Subtitle selection
* Audio track selection
* Playback quality controls
* Chromecast support
* Plex Home profile support
* Local and remote Plex server connections
* Clean native interface designed for Apple devices

Skunkflix does not provide or host movies, television shows or other media. Content is streamed from Plex Media Servers that the signed-in user is authorized to access.

Skunkflix is an independent application and is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by Plex.
